// ============================================================ relics: class-bound items bought with vault gold, kept forever.
// Three 5-piece SETS per class (one per build) + one loose relic. You wear 3 (4 after a Kings Grave win, 5 after Duskmoor).
// Wearing all 5 pieces of a set turns on its set bonus (p.setB). Relic effects mostly set flags on p.rm (relic mods) which
// the skills and the engine read; apply(p) runs inside recompute() AFTER skill passives, so relics can scale skill values.
const RELIC_COST={c:150,r:400,k:1000,l:400};
